(7102360, 1082172, 152252, '<td valign="top">The grain, blur and some darker parts represent how lost humans are in this world. The sandals FOOL us that we have some kind of protection from all the bad that is happening around us, but really they don''t cover our feet fully so yup we are fooled and vulnerable. Just hoping that the socks will do the job. But they don''t, and we end up with a tension pneumothorax or abdominal aneurysm, or just with a broken heart. All that because sandals (a protective symbol in this case) didn''t do a good job. So we realize that maybe "tennis" shoes would have been a better choice, but whoever is above us tries to make laws (like socks&amp;sandals law) that are supposed to make us believe that everything is under control, but trust me... it is not. Paranoia keeps growing...</td>', 'The grain, blur and some darker parts represent how lost humans are in this world. The sandals FOOL us that we have some kind of protection from all the bad that is happening around us, but really they don''t cover our feet fully so yup we are fooled and vulnerable. Just hoping that the socks will do the job. But they don''t, and we end up with a tension pneumothorax or abdominal aneurysm, or just with a broken heart. All that because sandals (a protective symbol in this case) didn''t do a good job. So we realize that maybe "tennis" shoes would have been a better choice, but whoever is above us tries to make laws (like socks&sandals law) that are supposed to make us believe that everything is under control, but trust me... it is not. Paranoia keeps growing...', '2013-09-13 00:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
