(7102475, 1081826, 138630, '<td valign="top">Quirky image and wonderful finish - congratulations on the top ten, Paul.  We want notes!  We want notes!<br/> <br/>ETA: Oh yeah, and I rescind my suggestion about the towel - the more I think about the challenge topic, the more I think the fold is perfect.  It looks so real - probably because it''s about the only thing that is LOL  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-09-13 09:54:04.</i></td>', 'Quirky image and wonderful finish - congratulations on the top ten, Paul.  We want notes!  We want notes! ETA: Oh yeah, and I rescind my suggestion about the towel - the more I think about the challenge topic, the more I think the fold is perfect.  It looks so real - probably because it''s about the only thing that is LOL  ', '2013-09-13 09:14:12.000000', '2013-09-13 10:54:04.000000', 0),
