(7102484, 1082172, 91496, '<td valign="top">So the obviously real, which is in reality fake finishes 4th from the bottom while the obviously fake, which are in reality fake (and thus fooled abosolutely no one) hog all the tops spots.  Ahhh DPC...  love it or ... something.  Kudos for understanding the nature and fun of the challenge.<br/> <br/>I once saw a Penn and Teller interview where Teller showed how he made something vanish and reappear in the same place as an exercise of his own compulsive insanity.  From the outside world it looked like nothing had happened, but he knew he had just done some very fancy magic.</td>', 'So the obviously real, which is in reality fake finishes 4th from the bottom while the obviously fake, which are in reality fake (and thus fooled abosolutely no one) hog all the tops spots.  Ahhh DPC...  love it or ... something.  Kudos for understanding the nature and fun of the challenge. I once saw a Penn and Teller interview where Teller showed how he made something vanish and reappear in the same place as an exercise of his own compulsive insanity.  From the outside world it looked like nothing had happened, but he knew he had just done some very fancy magic.', '2013-09-13 10:24:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7102486, 1082174, 131871, '<td valign="top">Congrats!! :) I love that you had a location to go to that seemed unreal. Awesome work!</td>', 'Congrats!! :) I love that you had a location to go to that seemed unreal. Awesome work!', '2013-09-13 10:54:16.000000', NULL, 0),
